Vendored ELFIO (8ae6cec5): add missing <cstdint> include.

elfio/elf_types.hpp defines the Elf_* aliases from uint16_t/uint32_t/
etc. without including <cstdint>; GCC 15 no longer provides it
transitively -> "'uint16_t' does not name a type". Current upstream
ELFIO carries this same include in this same file. Every other ELFIO
header chains through elf_types.hpp, so this one include covers the
header-only library. Path prefix matches the external/elfio/ staging
location.

--- a/external/elfio/elfio/elf_types.hpp
+++ b/external/elfio/elfio/elf_types.hpp
@@ -23,6 +23,8 @@
 #ifndef ELFTYPES_H
 #define ELFTYPES_H
 
+#include <cstdint>
+
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 namespace ELFIO {
 #endif
